摄像机，眼神真诚地与观众对视，并伸出手指做出点击屏幕的动作。主播说：“喜欢的姐妹一定要点个关注，今天直播间有专属福利哦！”\n**English:** Close-up shot. The host moves closer to the camera, making sincere eye contact with the audience, and moves her finger as if clicking on the screen. The host said, \"喜欢的姐妹一定要点个关注，今天直播间有专属福利哦！\""], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 16, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 17, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 17}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [-1640.6121949563938, -282.841793416013], "scale": 1.7088742511245927}}, "groups": [{"color": "#b58b2a", "font_size": 80, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "LTX2.3-Prompt Relay-全局提示词-分镜提示词-自动生成", "bounding": [190.71084594726562, 36.03834533691406, 2099.41064453125, 113.73677825927734]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "不要动它", "bounding": [-119.45731353759766, 1431.0357666015625, 621.1566162109375, 397.6000671386719]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 4, "title": "Group", "bounding": [1125.6236572265625, 204.38601684570312, 1521.237060546875, 657.8112182617188]}, {"color": "#b58b2a", "font_size": 60, "flags": {}, "id": 5, "title": "👉用我的邀请码注册送1000RH币👉邀请码：rh-v1542", "bounding": [190.61769104003906, -128, 1891.9930419921875, 83.41885375976562]}, {"color": "#b58b2a", "font_size": 80, "flags": {}, "id": 6, "title": "抖音、B站、YT等平台同名账号：青橙Lab", "bounding": [198.51498413085938, -269.50946044921875, 1826.8597412109375, 104.08698272705078]}, {"color": "#b58b2a", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 7, "title": "点击upload按钮上传要反推的视频", "bounding": [662.2517700195312, 206.1643524169922, 453.3345031738281, 651.06005859375]}, {"color": "#b58b2a", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 8, "title": "这里不要管它", "bounding": [1165.355712890625, 243.5322265625, 419.99993896484375, 481.6000061035156]}, {"color": "#